# Allowlist: exclude everything from the build context, then re-include only what the image build needs.
# For more help, visit the .dockerignore file reference guide at
# https://docs.docker.com/go/build-context-dockerignore/

*
!src
!Cargo.toml
!Makefile

# Never send editor or backup files, even inside re-included paths.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.rs.bk
